## Summary Flow

```
User types → Enter/Send
  ① setQuestion("") — textarea cleared immediately
  ② setTurns([…, {id, question, answer: null}]) — optimistic bubble
  ③ askRepository() → POST /api/v1/analyses/{id}/answer
       FastAPI → run_in_threadpool(service.answer, request)
         conversations.get_or_create + hybrid_history (SQLite)
         for round in 1..max_rounds:
           model.messages.create (investigation or synthesis role)
           parallel tool execution via ThreadPoolExecutor
           _validated_answer: InspectedSpan coverage check
           conversations.append_turn (SQLite persistence)
         → GroundedAnswer (citations, tool_trace, conversation_id)
  ④ setTurns: patch bubble with real answer
  ⑤ setSelectedCitation → fetchSource → SourcePanel (Monaco)
  ⑥ [Compare agents] → compareAgenticRetrieval → comparison grid
       Hit@5 / MRR / nDCG@10 per model, ranked paths
```

